## BRAND SPECIFICATION

### Colors
```css
:root {
  --bg: #0B0C0F;
  --surface: #11131A;
  --surface2: #181B26;
  --border: rgba(244, 246, 255, 0.08);
  --text: #F4F6FF;
  --muted: #8A8F9E;
  --gold: #F2C94C;
  --blue: #4F8EF7;
  --green: #4ECB71;
  --purple: #9B7FE8;
  --red: #E05C6E;
  --cyan: #06b6d4;
  --orange: #F6821F;
}
```

### Typography
- **Headers/Brand:** IBM Plex Mono or JetBrains Mono
- **Body:** System font stack (-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif)
- **Base size:** 13px, line-height 1.55
- **Monospace accents:** Labels, badges, metadata

### Components
- Cards: `background: var(--surface)`, `border: 1px solid var(--border)`, `border-radius: 9-11px`, `padding: 11-14px`
- Badges: `font-size: 9px`, `padding: 2px 6px`, `border-radius: 9px`, colored per type
- Buttons: Ghost style by default, filled for primary actions (gold bg, dark text)
- Toast: Fixed bottom-right, gold border, monospace text

