## BUILD ORDER

1. **Prompt Picker** (standalone HTML, same design as clipboard)
2. **Research Links** (standalone HTML, same design)
3. **Notes** (standalone HTML, same design)
4. **Hub Dashboard** (single HTML, unifies all tools, modeled on dist/index.html from Emma project)
5. **Gateway Worker** (Cloudflare, routes to all existing Workers, adds prompts/bookmarks/notes D1 tables)
6. **Dual-mode sync** (add GATEWAY_URL support to each tool)
7. **PWA wrapper** (manifest.json + sw.js + deploy to Cloudflare Pages)
8. **Knowledge Graph** (D1 schema + d3-force visualization)
9. **Dynamic Pages** (page registry + AI tab creation)
10. **MCP Server** (wraps all gateway routes as tools)
11. **AI Learning Loop** (auto-tag, pattern detection, contradiction checking, graph growth)

